  },
  {
   "type": "text",
   "id": "f_p1",
   "x": 40,
   "y": 1840,
   "width": 1520,
   "height": 15,
   "strokeColor": "#94a3b8",
   "text": "[07] Capability Taxonomy: a subagent for a bounded role in a fresh context, returning one document to the parent",
   "originalText": "[07] Capability Taxonomy: a subagent for a bounded role in a fresh context, returning one document to the parent",
   "fontSize": 12,
   "fontFamily": 3,
   "textAlign": "left",
   "verticalAlign": "top",
   "roughness": 0,
   "opacity": 100,
   "lineHeight": 1.25,
   "autoResize": false,
   "seed": 4800152
  },
  {
   "type": "text",
   "id": "f_p2",
   "x": 40,
   "y": 1865,
   "width": 1520,
   "height": 15,
   "strokeColor": "#94a3b8",
   "text": "[11] Adversarial Role Separation: the first of three roles that never overlap — this one decomposes and does not build or grade",
   "originalText": "[11] Adversarial Role Separation: the first of three roles that never overlap — this one decomposes and does not build or grade",
   "fontSize": 12,
   "fontFamily": 3,
   "textAlign": "left",
   "verticalAlign": "top",
   "roughness": 0,
   "opacity": 100,
   "lineHeight": 1.25,
   "autoResize": false,
   "seed": 4800153
  },
  {
   "type": "text",
   "id": "f_p3",
   "x": 40,
   "y": 1890,
   "width": 1520,
   "height": 15,
   "strokeColor": "#94a3b8",
   "text": "[16] The Permission Ladder: its limits are a list under the wrong key and a never list — advice, not the configured rung",
   "originalText": "[16] The Permission Ladder: its limits are a list under the wrong key and a never list — advice, not the configured rung",
   "fontSize": 12,
   "fontFamily": 3,
   "textAlign": "left",
   "verticalAlign": "top",
   "roughness": 0,
   "opacity": 100,
   "lineHeight": 1.25,
   "autoResize": false,
   "seed": 4800154
  },
  {
   "type": "text",
   "id": "f_gap",
   "x": 40,
   "y": 1925,
   "width": 1520,
   "height": 15,
   "strokeColor": "#e0f2fe",
   "text": "deliberately missing: a grant under the right key · a way to make the sprint cap true",
   "originalText": "deliberately missing: a grant under the right key · a way to make the sprint cap true",
   "fontSize": 12,
   "fontFamily": 3,
   "textAlign": "left",
   "verticalAlign": "top",
   "roughness": 0,
   "opacity": 100,
   "lineHeight": 1.25,
   "autoResize": false,
   "seed": 4800155
  },
  {
   "type": "text",
   "id": "f_proto",
   "x": 40,
   "y": 1955,
   "width": 1520,
   "height": 45,
   "strokeColor": "#94a3b8",
   "text": "prototype: reads a fabricated definition the way a harness would and reports what is granted against what is listed, which tool can create\nthe file the role must produce, and the sentence that forbids what the output shape requires; --narrowed adds the one frontmatter line\nthat closes the first gap · no model, no planning, no discovery",
   "originalText": "prototype: reads a fabricated definition the way a harness would and reports what is granted against what is listed, which tool can create\nthe file the role must produce, and the sentence that forbids what the output shape requires; --narrowed adds the one frontmatter line\nthat closes the first gap · no model, no planning, no discovery",
